WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:04.752
Inside the vehicle, watch the
blue ball and the red pendulum.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:08.157
As the vehicle braked,
which way did it turn?

00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:11.442
You can check the
synchronized outside view.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:17.601
The model gets time-ordered internal stills,
an apparatus description, and the question.

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:22.903
Between frames 5 and 6, the
vehicle braked and turned left.

00:00:23.307 --> 00:00:27.795
GPT-6.1 Sol answered
“brake and turn right.”

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:33.180
It got the first five events right, but
the complete sequence earned no credit.

00:00:33.822 --> 00:00:37.854
CaveBench covers 20 apparatuses
across five domains.

00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:42.434
Its 1,180 questions span one to six events.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:49.630
Sol recovered 136 of 200
six-event sequences, or 68%.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:59.496
Qwen3.5-9B rose from 0.5% to 20% six-event
accuracy with supervised fine-tuning.

00:00:59.848 --> 00:01:07.120
In dynamics, SFT solved 10 of 40.
The two SimPO runs solved 16 and 17.

